  "details": "For the past few weeks, I can no longer receive notifications. I cant receive friend requests, invites/invite requests. I can't get notifications when sharing emojis/stickers. I can't receive gifted VRC+ notifications either. No group notifications nothing. The ONLY and I mean ONLY notifications I get are vote kick notifications. I HAVE to go to the website to even check for basic notifications. However, since I can't get notifications, I also can't even send myself an invite to my own instances via the website...\n\nThis was temporarily fixed by switching from the beta back to normal builds but as stated it was temporary. It only lasted for 1 hour before going back to having the bug \n\nthis isnt tied down to one build number",
